+	 * 0x0358/0x758/0xB58, which are not the common status block; Android's
+	 * live reference is STATUS0=0 STATUS1=4 STATUS3=0x80 STATUS6=0x10
+	 * STATUS11=0x2a STATUS19=0xd6. Print the whole block in one line so the
